 ["Capnography measures:","Capnography ले के मापन गर्छ?",["Carbon dioxide in exhaled gas over time","Blood glucose","Urine output","Haemoglobin level"],0,"Capnography displays exhaled CO2 and waveform, supporting ventilation assessment.","Capnography ले निस्केको CO2 र waveform देखाएर ventilation मूल्याङ्कन गर्छ।","Anaesthesia Technology"],
 ["A pre-operative check should include:","Pre-operative जाँचमा के समावेश हुन्छ?",["Identity, procedure, consent, allergy and relevant history","Only patient's room number","Only height","Only meal preference"],0,"A structured preoperative check confirms patient, procedure, consent and relevant risks.","व्यवस्थित preoperative जाँचले पहिचान, प्रक्रिया, consent र जोखिम पुष्टि गर्छ।","Anaesthesia Technology"],
 ["Endotracheal tube placement is best confirmed with:","Endotracheal tube position पुष्टि गर्न कुन विधि महत्त्वपूर्ण हुन्छ?",["Sustained waveform capnography when available, with clinical assessment","Tube misting alone","Auscultation alone in every case","Chest movement alone"],0,"Waveform capnography is a key method for confirming tracheal placement and ongoing ventilation.","Waveform capnography tracheal placement र ventilation पुष्टि गर्ने मुख्य विधि हो।","Anaesthesia Technology"],
 ["A major purpose of the anaesthesia machine pre-use check is to:","Anaesthesia machine pre-use check को मुख्य उद्देश्य के हो?",["Identify faults before patient use","Increase gas consumption","Replace patient monitoring","Avoid equipment maintenance"],0,"A systematic check identifies supply, circuit, leak, ventilator and alarm problems before use.","व्यवस्थित जाँचले प्रयोगअघि gas supply, circuit, leak, ventilator र alarm समस्या पत्ता लगाउँछ।","Anaesthesia Technology"],
 ["Which structure must be protected during patient positioning?","बिरामीको position मिलाउँदा कुन संरचना जोगाउनुपर्छ?",["Peripheral nerves and pressure points","Only hair","Only clothing","Only fingernails"],0,"Careful positioning protects nerves, skin, eyes and pressure points from injury.","सही positioning ले nerve, छाला, आँखा र pressure point लाई चोटबाट जोगाउँछ।","Anaesthesia Technology"],
 ["Spinal anaesthesia is administered into the:","Spinal anaesthesia कहाँ दिइन्छ?",["Subarachnoid space containing CSF","Pleural cavity","Peritoneal cavity","Muscle only"],0,"Spinal anaesthesia introduces local anaesthetic into the cerebrospinal-fluid-containing subarachnoid space.","Spinal anaesthesia मा CSF भएको subarachnoid space मा local anaesthetic दिइन्छ।","Anaesthesia Technology"],
 ["Epidural anaesthesia is administered into the:","Epidural anaesthesia कहाँ दिइन्छ?",["Epidural space","Subdural space intentionally","Ventricle of brain","Pleural space"],0,"Epidural medication is delivered into the epidural space outside the dura.","Epidural औषधि dura बाहिरको epidural space मा दिइन्छ।","Anaesthesia Technology"],
 ["Minimum alveolar concentration (MAC) is a measure of:","MAC ले के जनाउँछ?",["Potency of inhaled anaesthetic agent","Oxygen cylinder pressure","Blood glucose","Muscle strength"],0,"MAC is the alveolar concentration preventing movement in 50% of subjects in response to a standard stimulus.","MAC standard stimulus मा ५०% व्यक्तिमा movement रोक्ने alveolar concentration हो।","Anaesthesia Technology"],
 ["Which is a possible early sign of local anaesthetic systemic toxicity?","Local anaesthetic systemic toxicity को सम्भावित प्रारम्भिक संकेत कुन हो?",["Circumoral numbness or tinnitus","Improved hearing","Increased appetite","Hair loss"],0,"Neurological symptoms may precede seizures and cardiovascular toxicity; follow emergency protocol.","दौरा र cardiovascular toxicity अघि neurological लक्षण देखिन सक्छन्; emergency protocol पालना गर्नुहोस्।","Anaesthesia Technology"],
 ["A patient in recovery develops airway obstruction. The priority is to:","Recovery मा airway obstruction भए प्राथमिकता के हो?",["Call for help and assess/open airway immediately","Offer oral food","Leave unattended","Document later only"],0,"Airway and breathing problems are immediate priorities in recovery.","Recovery मा airway र breathing समस्या तुरुन्त प्राथमिकतामा पर्छ।","Anaesthesia Technology"],
 ["Pre-eclampsia is relevant to anaesthesia because it may involve:","Pre-eclampsia anaesthesia मा किन महत्त्वपूर्ण हुन्छ?",["Hypertension and potential maternal-organ involvement","Only mild skin rash","Isolated low blood glucose","Bone fracture"],0,"Pre-eclampsia can involve severe hypertension and maternal-organ dysfunction, requiring careful multidisciplinary planning.","Pre-eclampsia मा गम्भीर hypertension र अंगको समस्या हुन सक्छ; multidisciplinary तयारी चाहिन्छ।","Advanced Anaesthesia"],
 ["Pulmonary function tests help assess:","Pulmonary function test ले के मूल्याङ्कन गर्छ?",["Airflow obstruction, restriction and respiratory reserve","Blood group","Liver enzymes","Platelet function"],0,"PFTs help characterise ventilatory patterns and respiratory reserve.","PFT ले ventilatory pattern र respiratory reserve बुझ्न मद्दत गर्छ।","Advanced Anaesthesia"],
 ["A ventilator is used to:","Ventilator किन प्रयोग गरिन्छ?",["Support or control ventilation","Measure haemoglobin","Sterilise instruments","Measure blood pressure only"],0,"Ventilators support or control gas exchange by delivering breaths according to a selected mode.","Ventilator ले छानिएको mode अनुसार सास दिन सहयोग वा नियन्त्रण गर्छ।","Advanced Anaesthesia"],
 ["Newborn resuscitation should follow:","नवजात resuscitation कुन आधारमा गर्नुपर्छ?",["Current neonatal life-support guidance and trained-team protocol","Adult-only protocol without adjustment","Unsupervised improvisation","Routine feeding first"],0,"Neonatal resuscitation differs from adult resuscitation and must follow current neonatal guidance.","नवजात resuscitation वयस्कभन्दा फरक हुन्छ र हालको neonatal guideline पालना गर्नुपर्छ।","Advanced Anaesthesia"]
